{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_003_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:be1730aa22fe1f7469dd0be78c70dc4db66744253f78e1ffa643e49dbb1133e6",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_003_23:5_01_003_23_a:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8517c726d0ed9228c28f5960c4349fbc62802c425e22fe9d4d5c5db7404527b1",
      "text": "Ciao☆ ●●●●プロデューサー。情人节\n巧克力，非常感谢你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_003_23:5_01_003_23_a:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98f31f82af77c4e5c81fab53f906d289a193442f63a716524811f6c26a14b0ce",
      "text": "说老实话，我一直很期待哦。要是今年也能\n从你那里收到巧克力就好了呢——像这样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_003_23:5_01_003_23_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61ab5348152723e3a6a3a5bfd41c01ad0227aa9bf142cb491e082024d6b5f2b6",
      "text": "无论是味道还是你的心意，都非常甜美美味哦。\n……开玩笑的啦☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_003_23:5_01_003_23_a:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7091dfef79f0e08a97641ee44b9171e6419f90db4c200c2b40da212377851db5",
      "text": "那真是太好了！\n因为犹豫了很久才选出来的，我也松了一口气。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_003_23:5_01_003_23_a:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ba784a4c63a63b92896d7eedbcbedb06089cec4616fcf62b3332b48720eadc9",
      "text": "真伤脑筋啊……被你这么一说，\n我可就变得更开心了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_003_23:5_01_003_23_a:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afd3b18bdabc0cab494b042dbb88c0b3d29e4401bdf6884bc18c7e67272223fc",
      "text": "在烦恼选什么好的期间，你一直都在\n想着我的事情，对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_003_23:5_01_003_23_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e7d76134f4446a73596c15d9ea90603df29c2983955ff4d4d0ed67434a2573d",
      "text": "是的。我一直在思考给北斗先生送什么好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_003_23:5_01_003_23_a:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a0d682a935a287a2f5d6fdce7797bc1eb40243dbbc3dfe681db7aaa54bdb33f",
      "text": "这本来就已经是独一无二无可替代的特别之物了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_003_23:5_01_003_23_a:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e18d2966c20cf8f02c55db4d555ed2eaadea479bbce9b95a2f28cab06736ecf0",
      "text": "制作人，\n明年的情人节我也可以期待一下吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_003_23:5_01_003_23_a:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c3e0eab7135bbf0124c363d162784a0708abfe045d94917138ffb36a58b21a3",
      "text": "那是当然了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_003_23:5_01_003_23_a:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:034944e79a6cc274ddc4d38551655528998447c18d8090304b9cacb2904c10cb",
      "text": "呵呵，谢谢你。\n我已经开始期待明年的情人节了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
